":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2079,"username":"KeinAdmin Brillenträger","time":1461085777,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":46295,"threadID":3512,"userID":2079,"username":"KeinAdmin Brillenträger","subject":"","time":1461086417,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1125,"username":"Stabiler Jesus","time":1461086899,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>ich würde <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1-sky/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Sky</a> vorschlagen</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":46296,"threadID":3512,"userID":1933,"username":"Re(MiiX)","subject":"","time":1461087993,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wär dabei</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":46298,"threadID":3512,"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","subject":"","time":1461089947,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","time":1461090715,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Darf ich Spinbot anmachen? <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":46299,"threadID":3512,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1461090831,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","time":1461092966,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ach yolo... <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1-sky/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Sky</a> Du machst jetzt mit.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":46300,"threadID":3512,"userID":1504,"username":"Marcello","subject":"","time":1461093026,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","time":1461104070,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich möchte auch mitmachen, wenn es noch geht.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":46301,"threadID":3512,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1461094544,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1504,"username":"Marcello","time":1461094745,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Klar. Es ist noch genug Zeit sich zu melden. <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>So wird das btw im Stream bzw im YT-Video aussehen.. <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span><br><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":46302,"threadID":3512,"userID":2101,"username":"Hypnoxas","subject":"","time":1461099945,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","time":1461104074,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich würde auch gerne mitspielen <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":46303,"threadID":3512,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1461104042,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wer bringt <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1825-nachtfrische/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Nachtfrische</a> mal &quot;schnell&quot; die Basics bei?!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":46305,"threadID":3512,"userID":1952,"username":"Senpai","subject":"","time":1461139691,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich hab so Bock auf Blitz</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":46307,"threadID":3512,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1461141814,"lastEditTime":1461143061,"editCount":3,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":1852,"editor":"VinceG","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Das Turnier wird dann mit Punkten aufgebaut sein. Jeder wird eine gewisse Zahl an Partien spielen und immer gegen Spieler die eine ähnliche oder gleiche Performance abgeliefert haben.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1ija6MgfmWgeOhHfq9mLnIBnBC1xo6q80VFSkJIcHK0k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ähm... ich habe mir auch ein paar Regeln überlegt.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p>§1 Betrügen</p></div><ul>\n<li>Das Betrügen ist egal unter welchen Umständen untersagt.</li>\n<li>Das verwenden von Computern zur Berechnung des perfekten Zuges, Absprache mit anderen Spielern oder Absprechen mit dem Gegenspieler sind verboten.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p>§2 Kommunikation nach einer Partie</p></div><ul><li>Nach einer Partie ist es erlaubt noch einmal die Partie durch zu gehen und mit dem Gegenspieler zu besprechen.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>§3 Kommunikation während der Partie</p></div><ul><li>Während der Partie ist es den Spielern erlaubt mit dem Gegenspieler zu kommunizieren, solange sich die Spieler an §1 halten und keinen Absprachen treffen.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>§4 Vertrauen</p></div><ul><li>Das ganze Turnier beruht auf Vertrauen und dient zur Unterhaltung der Community. Falls das Vertrauen gebrochen wird kann das zur strengen Überwachung und damit zu weniger Spielspaß führen.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p><br>§5 Unangemessenes Verhalten</p></div><ul>\n<li>Unangebrachtes Verhalten u.o. beleidigende Aussagen können zum Ausschluss dieses und folgender Turniere führen.</li>\n<li>Falls man einen anderen Spieler aufgrund einer geäußerten Beleidigung zurück beleidigt kann das zum Ausschluss dieses und folgender Turniere führen.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>§6 Spaß und Lernen<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Das Turnier dient zum erweitern der Schachkenntnisse.</li>\n<li>Das Turnier wird aus Spaß veranstaltet.</li>\n</ul>","polls":[]},{"postID":46308,"threadID":3512,"userID":1952,"username":"Senpai","subject":"","time":1461142197,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Kann nicht auf das Doc zugreifen <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😛</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":46309,"threadID":3512,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1461143067,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1952,"username":"Senpai","time":1461143176,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Jetzt?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":46310,"threadID":3512,"userID":1998,"username":"aXaX.","subject":"","time":1461150015,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","time":1461150618,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hi,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Can i join this even if i not speak German ? I really like Chess -)</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Thanks,</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":46311,"threadID":3512,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1461150642,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1998,"username":"aXaX.","time":1461152393,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>aXaX.</strong></cite><p>Can i join this even if i not speak German ? I really like Chess -)<br></p></blockquote><p>Ahm. Sure.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":46312,"threadID":3512,"userID":1758,"username":"Sexy Vengeance","subject":"","time":1461150882,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>kann mir das Doc auch nicht ansehen</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":46313,"threadID":3512,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1461151586,"lastEditTime":1461152200,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":1852,"editor":"VinceG","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich kanns mir aber anschauen...auch wenn ich nicht angemeldet bin. mh.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n\n\nSpieler\nPunkte\n1.\n2.\n3.\n4.\n5.\n6.\n\n\nA\n1\n0\n1\n-\n-\n-\n-\n\n\nB\n1½\n1\n½\n-\n-\n-\n-\n\n\nC\n1½\n1\n½\n-\n-\n-\n-\n\n\nD\n1\n0\n1\n-\n-\n-\n-\n\n\nE\n½\n½\n0\n-\n-\n-\n-\n\n\nF\n½\n½\n0\n-\n-\n-\n-\n\n\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Partie 1.<br></p>\n\n\nPUNKTE\nSPIELER\n\n\n\n0Pkt. vs 0Pkt.\nA vs B\n0 - 1\n\n\n0Pkt. vs 0Pkt.\nC vs D\n1  -  0\n\n\n0Pkt. vs 0Pkt.\nE vs F\n½ - ½\n\n\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Partie 2.<br></p>\n\n\nPUNKTE\nSPIELER\n\n\n\n1Pkt. vs 1Pkt.\nB vs C\n½ - ½\n\n\n0Pkt. vs ½Pkt.\nA vs E\n1 - 0\n\n\n½Pkt. vs 0Pkt.\nF vs D\n0 - 1\n\n\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Partie3.<br></p>\n\n\nPUNKTE\nSPIELER\n\n\n\n1Pkt. vs 1½Pkt.\nA vs B\n?\n\n\n1½Pkt. vs 1Pkt.\nC vs D\n?\n\n\n½Pkt. vs ½Pkt.\nE vs F\n?","polls":[]},{"postID":46314,"threadID":3512,"userID":2064,"username":"Gammly","subject":"","time":1461153173,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>kann ich mitmachen verstehe aber nix von Schach gewinne aber trzdm immer.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":46315,"threadID":3512,"userID":2164,"username":"Edge","subject":"","time":1461154508,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Bin zwar der schlechteste Schach Spieler aber ich mach mit!  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😛</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":46320,"threadID":3512,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1461163567,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote clas